{"title":"Lesson 04 · My Father Works at a Computer Company 我爸爸在電腦公司工作","short":"L04 電腦公司 · prep","kick":"Let’s Learn Mandarin 來！學華語 · Book 1 · Lesson 4 · topic: occupations (II) · prep for class with Chunhua (Tuesdays, 5 PM ET)","h1":"Lesson 04 · My Father Works at a Computer Company <span>我爸爸在電腦公司工作</span>","key":"<span class=\"real\">REAL textbook clip</span> = the textbook’s own recording, cut per line / per word with our audio_chop tool (each cut re-checked by a second transcription). <span class=\"syn\">▶ synthetic</span> = a computer voice (edge-tts, Taiwan voices HsiaoChen / YunJhe), used only where the textbook has no recording. Trust the real tracks when they differ.","foot":"Dialogue, vocab, grammar, pinyin focus: Let’s Learn Mandarin Book 1 textbook pp. 041-056 (Lesson 4). English translations, ‘Your turn’ lines, quiz and [ours] notes are ours, not the textbook’s. The textbook’s Text track repeats the dialogue at the same speed with pauses (‘Now it’s your turn’), so there is no separate slow pass to offer. Synthetic clips are not from the textbook.","emoji":"📘","color":"#3B5BDB","subtitle":"Let's Learn Mandarin B1 · occupations","id":"lm_b1_l04","kind":"textbook","source":"Textbook: Let's Learn Mandarin Book 1","sections":[{"type":"tracks","title":"Textbook audio · real recordings","items":[{"label":"B1-L04-1-Text (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T1-Text.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L04-1-Text","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L04-2-Vocabulary (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T2-Vocabulary.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L04-2-Vocabulary","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L04-3-Grammar (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T3-Grammar.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L04-3-Grammar","real":true}]},{"label":"B1-L04-4-Pinyin (whole track)","badge":"REAL textbook recording","audio":[{"src":"audio/T4-Pinyin.mp3","label":"Textbook track B1-L04-4-Pinyin","real":true}]}]},{"type":"lines","title":"Dialogue","zh":{"t":"課文","s":"课文"},"kick":"tap a line · G = Gloria Lee (woman) · 明 = 王明文 (man)","items":[{"id":"d1","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"Mingwen, may I ask, where do your father and mother work?","cells":[{"ch":"明","py":"Míng","t":2,"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2,"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]],"pz":"，"},{"ch":"請","py":"qǐng","t":3,"s":"请","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"問","py":"wèn","t":4,"s":"问","pz":"，"},{"ch":"你","py":"nǐ","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"哪","py":"nǎ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ná"},{"ch":"裡","py":"lǐ","t":3,"s":"里"},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]],"pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"chip":"-ng","lab":"míng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"wén","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"wén","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"q","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"nǐ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"b","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"},{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǎ lǐ","cue":"3+3: say ná lǐ","kind":"33"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"zuò","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d1.mp3","label":"明文，請問，你爸爸，媽媽在哪裡工作？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d2","spk":"明","g":"m","en":"My father works at a computer company, and my mother is an elementary-school teacher.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"電","py":"diàn","t":4,"s":"电","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"腦","py":"nǎo","t":3,"s":"脑"},{"ch":"公","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"司","py":"sī","t":1,"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"我","py":"wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["u","ü","#0B7285"],"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"老","py":"lǎo","t":3},{"ch":"師","py":"shī","t":1,"s":"师","pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"sī","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"},{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"sym":"ü","col":"#0B7285","lab":"ü","cue":"say ‘ee’, then round the lips","kind":"u"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"xué","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d2.mp3","label":"我爸爸在電腦公司工作，我媽媽是小學老師。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d3","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"Is your father’s work busy?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"的","py":"de","t":5},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2},{"ch":"不","py":"bù","t":4},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d3.mp3","label":"你爸爸的工作忙不忙？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d4","spk":"明","g":"m","en":"His work is very busy; he’s tired every day.","cells":[{"ch":"他","py":"Tā","t":1,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]},{"ch":"的","py":"de","t":5},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4},{"ch":"很","py":"hěn","t":3,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"]},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"每","py":"měi","t":3},{"ch":"天","py":"tiān","t":1},{"ch":"都","py":"dōu","t":1},{"ch":"很","py":"hěn","t":3},{"ch":"累","py":"lèi","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d4.mp3","label":"他的工作很忙，他每天都很累。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d5","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"How about your mom?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3},{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"呢","py":"ne","t":5,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d5.mp3","label":"你媽媽呢？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d6","spk":"明","g":"m","en":"She likes kids; she says teaching isn’t tiring.","cells":[{"ch":"她","py":"Tā","t":1},{"ch":"喜","py":"xǐ","t":3},{"ch":"歡","py":"huān","t":1,"s":"欢"},{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3},{"ch":"孩","py":"hái","t":2},{"ch":"子","py":"zi","t":5,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"她","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"說","py":"shuō","t":1,"s":"说"},{"ch":"教","py":"jiāo","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"書","py":"shū","t":1,"s":"书"},{"ch":"不","py":"bú","t":2,"mk":["bu","↗","#17A398"],"said":"bú"},{"ch":"累","py":"lèi","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"bú lèi","cue":"bù → bú before a 4th","kind":"bu"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d6.mp3","label":"她喜歡小孩子，她說教書不累。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"d7","spk":"G","g":"f","en":"My father is also a teacher; he teaches French at a college.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"也","py":"yě","t":3},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4},{"ch":"老","py":"lǎo","t":3},{"ch":"師","py":"shī","t":1,"s":"师","pz":"，"},{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"大","py":"dà","t":4},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学"},{"ch":"教","py":"jiāo","t":1},{"ch":"法","py":"Fǎ","t":3},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/d7.mp3","label":"我爸爸也是老師，他在大學教法文。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]}]},{"type":"vocab","title":"Vocabulary","zh":{"t":"生詞","s":"生词"},"kick":"tap a word · REAL = textbook vocab track","items":[{"id":"v1","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"father, dad","note":"second 爸 is neutral, short and light","cells":[{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5}],"cues":[{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"b","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v1.mp3","label":"爸爸 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v2","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"mother, mom","note":"second 媽 is neutral","cells":[{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v2.mp3","label":"媽媽 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v3","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"teacher","note":"老 is a half-third ↓ before 師; sh = Position 2","cells":[{"ch":"老","py":"lǎo","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"師","py":"shī","t":1,"s":"师","mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"lǎo","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"shī","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v3.mp3","label":"老師 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v4","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"busy","note":"-ng ending; 忙不忙 = A-not-A question","cells":[{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2,"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]}],"cues":[{"chip":"-ng","lab":"máng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v4.mp3","label":"忙 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v5","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"very","note":"usually a half-third ↓ before the next word (很忙, 很累)","cells":[{"ch":"很","py":"hěn","t":3,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"],"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]]}],"cues":[{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"hěn","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"hěn","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v5.mp3","label":"很 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v6","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"every day","note":"每 is a half-third ↓ before 天","cells":[{"ch":"每","py":"měi","t":3,"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"天","py":"tiān","t":1,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]}],"cues":[{"chip":"ei","lab":"měi","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"},{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v6.mp3","label":"每天 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v7","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"tired, tiring","note":"ei like ‘vein’; 不累 is bú lèi (不→bú before 4th)","cells":[{"ch":"累","py":"lèi","t":4}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v7.mp3","label":"累 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v8","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"to like","note":"歡 is 1st, not neutral. 喜歡不喜歡 = A-not-A","cells":[{"ch":"喜","py":"xǐ","t":3,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"歡","py":"huān","t":1,"s":"欢"}],"cues":[{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"x","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v8.mp3","label":"喜歡 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v9","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"children, kids","note":"子 is neutral; cf. Lesson 3 小孩 / 孩子","cells":[{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3},{"ch":"孩","py":"hái","t":2},{"ch":"子","py":"zi","t":5,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v9.mp3","label":"小孩子 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v10","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"to say","note":"sh = Position 2; -uo = ‘oo-oh’","cells":[{"ch":"說","py":"shuō","t":1,"s":"说","fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]]}],"cues":[{"chip":"uo","lab":"shuō","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v10.mp3","label":"說 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v11","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"to teach","note":"j = Position 1, no puff; iao ≈ ‘ee-ow’","cells":[{"ch":"教","py":"jiāo","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v11.mp3","label":"教 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v12","grp":"Words 1-12","en":"French language","note":"法 is a half-third ↓ before 文","cells":[{"ch":"法","py":"Fǎ","t":3},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v12.mp3","label":"法文 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v13","grp":"Phrases 13","en":"the job of teaching","note":"教 + 書, ‘to teach’ as an occupation","cells":[{"ch":"教","py":"jiāo","t":1},{"ch":"書","py":"shū","t":1,"s":"书"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v13.mp3","label":"教書 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v14","grp":"Supplementary 14-15","en":"an example of a surname","note":"3rd tone; contrast 里 lǐ / 裡","cells":[{"ch":"李","py":"Lǐ","t":3}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v14.mp3","label":"李 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"v15","grp":"Supplementary 14-15","en":"today","note":"","cells":[{"ch":"今","py":"jīn","t":1},{"ch":"天","py":"tiān","t":1}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/v15.mp3","label":"今天 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]}]},{"type":"hints","title":"Tricky sounds in Lesson 4","kick":"tap a card to hear it","items":[{"word":{"t":"爸爸"},"py":"bà ba","hint":"second 爸 is neutral, short and light. Contrast the full 4th on the first 爸.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v1.mp3","label":"爸爸","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"媽媽","s":"妈妈"},"py":"mā ma","hint":"second 媽 is neutral. mā = m + a, high flat, then a light ma.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v2.mp3","label":"媽媽","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"老師","s":"老师"},"py":"lǎo shī","hint":"sh = Position 2 (tip raised). 老 is a half-third ↓ before 師. iao/ao: 老 = ao (‘ow’).","audio":[{"src":"audio/v3.mp3","label":"老師","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"忙"},"py":"máng","hint":"-ng: back of the tongue up, out through the nose. 忙不忙 is the A-not-A question.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v4.mp3","label":"忙","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"喜歡","s":"喜欢"},"py":"xǐ huān","hint":"x = Position 1. 喜 xǐ is a half-third ↓ before 歡. 歡 huān: h + uan, high flat 1st (not neutral).","audio":[{"src":"audio/v8.mp3","label":"喜歡","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"說","s":"说"},"py":"shuō","hint":"sh = Position 2 + -uo (‘oo-oh’). Not s (Position-adjacent hiss) and not 所 suǒ.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v10.mp3","label":"說","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"教"},"py":"jiāo","hint":"j = Position 1 (tip behind bottom teeth), no puff. iao ≈ ‘ee-ow’.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v11.mp3","label":"教","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"累"},"py":"lèi","hint":"ei like ‘vein’. 不累 is said bú lèi because 累 is 4th.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v7.mp3","label":"累","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"教書","s":"教书"},"py":"jiāo shū","hint":"教 + 書: ‘teaching’ as a job. 書 shū: sh = Position 2 + u (not ‘shoe’ with English sh).","audio":[{"src":"audio/v13.mp3","label":"教書","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"很"},"py":"hěn","hint":"Usually a low half-third ↓, not a full dip-and-rise: 很忙, 很累, 每天都很累.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v5.mp3","label":"很","real":true}]}],"cards":[["Textbook pinyin focus: initials z c s; finals ou, -ua, -ong","z (no puff) vs c (puff), tip on the top teeth. ou ≈ ‘oh’ (都 dōu); -ua ≈ ‘wah’; -ong ends -ng (工 gōng). No initial before -ua is written wa (挖 wā). 不 is bù before 1st/2nd/3rd and bú before a 4th."]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Grammar","items":[["Affirmative-negative questions, A-not-A (textbook Grammar 1)","Instead of adding 嗎, use the verb plus its negative: S + Vs 不 Vs？ or S + V 不 V + O？ 你忙不忙？ 你是不是學生？ (1) 他們忙不忙？ (2) 你今天累不累？ (3) 你是不是學生？ (4) Nancy 喜歡不喜歡教書？ [ours] This feels more neutral than 嗎."],["有沒有 — A-not-A with 有 (Grammar 1-2)","有 is negated with 沒, so the A-not-A form is 有沒有: S + 有 + 沒有 + O？ 你有沒有電腦？ 你哥哥有沒有孩子？ 他有沒有兄弟姊妹？ 王小文有沒有姊姊？"],["呢 — ‘how about…?’ (Grammar 2)","呢 is used when context is already established. After a noun or pronoun it means ‘How about N?’: 我姓王，您呢？ 我叫小文，您呢？ 我是臺灣人，你呢？ 我有兩個弟弟，你呢？ 你媽媽呢？"],["的 — the possessive particle (Grammar 3)","的 sits between the possessor and the possessed: 我的電腦, 他的工作, Gloria 的電腦, 明文的老師, 我的名字. 我喜歡我的工作。"],["的 can be dropped with close family (Grammar 3-2)","When a personal pronoun is followed by a family or close-relationship term, 的 can be omitted: 我媽媽, 我爸爸, 我妹妹, 他兒子. It is usually required otherwise: 明文的媽媽, 家文的爸爸, 大文的姊姊."]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Sound notes","items":[["Textbook pinyin focus: initials z c s, finals ou, -ua, -ong","z / c = Position 3 (tip on the top front teeth); c has a big puff, z does not. s is a hiss with the tip near the ridge: 司 sī, 說 is sh, not s. ou ≈ ‘oh’: 都 dōu. -ua ≈ ‘wah’: 話. -ong ends -ng: 工 gōng, 從. (textbook pp.055-056)"],["When -ua has no initial, write wa","Textbook note: with no initial in front of -ua, it is written “wa”, e.g. wā 挖 (to dig)."],["不 tone changes (textbook p.055)","The tone of 不 changes based on the syllable that follows. Before a 1st, 2nd, or 3rd, 不 is bù and marked 4th: bù máng 不忙, bù gōngzuò 不工作, bù hǎo 不好. Before a 4th, 不 is bú and marked 2nd: bú shì 不是, bú lèi 不累."],["Neutral 爸 / 媽, and 很 as a half-third","爸爸 bà ba, 媽媽 mā ma: the second syllable is short and light. 很 hěn is usually a low half-third ↓ before the next word (很忙, 很累), not a full dip-and-rise."]]},{"type":"lines","title":"Your turn","zh":null,"kick":"tap to hear, then say it yourself","items":[{"id":"y1","spk":"我","g":"m","en":"My father works at a computer company. (template: swap in your real family)","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"],"fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]]},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"電","py":"diàn","t":4,"s":"电","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"],"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"]]},{"ch":"腦","py":"nǎo","t":3,"s":"脑"},{"ch":"公","py":"gōng","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"],"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]},{"ch":"司","py":"sī","t":1,"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"wǒ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"wǒ","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"b","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"},{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"diàn","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"gōng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"sī","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y1.mp3","label":"我爸爸在電腦公司工作。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y2","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Is your father’s work busy?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"的","py":"de","t":5},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2},{"ch":"不","py":"bù","t":4},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y2.mp3","label":"你爸爸的工作忙不忙？ · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y3","spk":"","g":"m","en":"His work is very busy. He is tired every day.","cells":[{"ch":"他","py":"Tā","t":1,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]},{"ch":"的","py":"de","t":5},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4},{"ch":"很","py":"hěn","t":3,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"],"fc":[["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]]},{"ch":"忙","py":"máng","t":2,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"每","py":"měi","t":3,"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"天","py":"tiān","t":1},{"ch":"都","py":"dōu","t":1},{"ch":"很","py":"hěn","t":3},{"ch":"累","py":"lèi","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"hěn","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"měi","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y3.mp3","label":"他的工作很忙，他每天都很累。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y4","spk":"","g":"m","en":"How about your mom?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3},{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"呢","py":"ne","t":5,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y4.mp3","label":"你媽媽呢？ · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y5","spk":"","g":"m","en":"My mother is an elementary-school teacher. (template)","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"媽","py":"mā","t":1,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"媽","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"妈"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["u","ü","#0B7285"]},{"ch":"老","py":"lǎo","t":3},{"ch":"師","py":"shī","t":1,"s":"师","pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"x","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"sym":"ü","col":"#0B7285","lab":"ü","cue":"say ‘ee’, then round the lips","kind":"u"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y5.mp3","label":"我媽媽是小學老師。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y6","spk":"","g":"m","en":"My father is also a teacher. He teaches French at a college. (template / from the dialogue)","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"爸","py":"bà","t":4},{"ch":"爸","py":"ba","t":5},{"ch":"也","py":"yě","t":3},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4},{"ch":"老","py":"lǎo","t":3},{"ch":"師","py":"shī","t":1,"s":"师","pz":"，"},{"ch":"他","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"大","py":"dà","t":4},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学"},{"ch":"教","py":"jiāo","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"法","py":"Fǎ","t":3},{"ch":"文","py":"wén","t":2,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y6.mp3","label":"我爸爸也是老師，他在大學教法文。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]}]},{"type":"lines","title":"Review from Lesson 3","zh":null,"kick":"real Lesson 1 clips · tap to hear","items":[{"id":"r1","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Gloria, is your older sister a student?","cells":[{"ch":"Gloria","py":"Gloria","lat":1},{"pu":"，"},{"ch":"妳","py":"nǐ","t":3,"s":"你","mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"生","py":"shēng","t":1,"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]]},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ jiě","cue":"3+3: say ní jiě","kind":"33"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"j","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"jiě","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"},{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"shì","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"shēng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"shēng","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r1.mp3","label":"Gloria，妳姊姊是學生嗎？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r2","spk":"","g":"m","en":"She isn’t a student; she graduated from college.","cells":[{"ch":"她","py":"Tā","t":1,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"]},{"ch":"不","py":"bú","t":2,"mk":["bu","↗","#17A398"],"said":"bú"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["u","ü","#0B7285"]},{"ch":"生","py":"shēng","t":1,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"她","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"大","py":"dà","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学"},{"ch":"畢","py":"bì","t":4,"s":"毕","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"業","py":"yè","t":4,"s":"业"},{"ch":"了","py":"le","t":5,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"bú shì","cue":"bù → bú before a 4th","kind":"bu"},{"sym":"ü","col":"#0B7285","lab":"ü","cue":"say ‘ee’, then round the lips","kind":"u"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"d","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r2.mp3","label":"她不是學生，她大學畢業了。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r3","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Where does she work?","cells":[{"ch":"她","py":"Tā","t":1},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"哪","py":"nǎ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ná"},{"ch":"裡","py":"lǐ","t":3,"s":"里","mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]],"pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǎ lǐ","cue":"3+3: say ná lǐ","kind":"33"},{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"lǐ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"zuò","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r3.mp3","label":"她在哪裡工作？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r4","spk":"","g":"m","en":"My older sister works at a bank, and her husband works at a computer company.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"wó"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"銀","py":"yín","t":2,"s":"银","fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"]]},{"ch":"行","py":"háng","t":2,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"]},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"，"},{"ch":"她","py":"tā","t":1},{"ch":"先","py":"xiān","t":1},{"ch":"生","py":"sheng","t":5},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"電","py":"diàn","t":4,"s":"电"},{"ch":"腦","py":"nǎo","t":3,"s":"脑"},{"ch":"公","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"司","py":"sī","t":1},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"wǒ jiě","cue":"3+3: say wó jiě","kind":"33"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"yín","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"},{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r4.mp3","label":"我姊姊在銀行工作，她先生在電腦公司工作。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]}]},{"type":"quiz","title":"Self-quiz","kick":"say it aloud, then tap to reveal","items":[["Q1. Ask: ‘Where do your father and mother work?’","A: 你爸爸、媽媽在哪裡工作？ Nǐ bàba, māma zài nǎlǐ gōngzuò?"],["Q2. Say: ‘My father works at a computer company.’","A: 我爸爸在電腦公司工作。Wǒ bàba zài diànnǎo gōngsī gōngzuò."],["Q3. Ask: ‘Is your father’s work busy?’ (A-not-A)","A: 你爸爸的工作忙不忙？ Nǐ bàba de gōngzuò máng bù máng?"],["Q4. Say: ‘His work is very busy. He is tired every day.’","A: 他的工作很忙，他每天都很累。Tā de gōngzuò hěn máng, tā měitiān dōu hěn lèi."],["Q5. How do you ask ‘Do you have a computer?’ with 有沒有?","A: 你有沒有電腦？"],["Q6. ‘How about your mom?’","A: 你媽媽呢？ Nǐ māma ne?"],["Q7. Do you need 的 in 我媽媽 vs 明文的媽媽?","A: 我媽媽 — 的 can be dropped after a pronoun + family term. 明文的媽媽 — 的 is usually required."]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-11-17T09:41-05:00"}